      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f0ee9a5518ad5260aa2b446e88baf9632d086274dc58b33e112d7dac7976d150",
      "words_sha256": "3729b952c37b60ee72d333ba6361606408c155d26d6de1c2a885b06b5a280554",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "04432b89658e118796a262d34498b1dd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年澳网，他第一次打进大满贯第三轮，随后输给谢尔顿。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "89e1c31400b6763e73fe43afd6e90c9e7820adff0b53727b55047e26ebbdc24d",
      "words_sha256": "142dbff8e62a84659c7da6aacacd5900a80b3bb5785f59e31f3aae0bb1b0808d",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fdf1a3b9dd829ec003cc30b0fdec4a31",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四月，回到家乡蒙特卡洛。他击败德米纳尔，再进大师赛4强，也进入了世界前二十。第一次捧杯之后，他又一次在大师赛，走到了最后一个周末。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fc199fa29f84f72c524c003933c82eab14821050c1a014dc3916b7adde1f9855",
      "words_sha256": "605d87375864818b530bad33f32cbcbb146233be102f37954f196f6bd0fd3807",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cecf27ffb44c5c21df6789163518a1e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但五月，左脚伤让赛程停了下来。法网赢过首轮，他却在第二轮开赛前退出。随后，也错过了温网。从五月到七月，近两个月没有正式比赛。下一次走上赛场，要等到格施塔德。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3ffd57e3a47b677380ea375ab8767b40d4e87413660dd7b45e23a8401dc2e388",
      "words_sha256": "b8fd2e6d7fa8ea9e6dc529a4b194249cd464ed569893b5550045c78a34fd1fc5",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d7007d851af206106f66a3c27a064ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七月十五日，复出首战。他在先丢一盘后，逆转汉夫曼。能回来比赛了，成绩却没有立刻稳定。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0abfb149e9019bd699a9bea4cfa4346af6aecfeaf5af3b4d7c9e7e84cb92416d",
      "words_sha256": "16bbe66bce069bd8fdaa592a961ae303f31cd1617c5b38f83f42023b85d5c013",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5b7047914c9c3711fdc0db0a0397036e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月成都，作为头号种子，首轮轮空后，他第一场就输给资格赛球员哈里斯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3f172be967440f6127bd27b68042fe60d923cfa458c90cd114704b0f6c122784",
      "words_sha256": "7350ed1129d7334cc1c4a6456b21be525bb2e6c0a14c8fc273c01bb6fbcc07fe",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d92dd92b00820ff869898c094b822af2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了东京，他又逆转西西帕斯，击败菲斯，重新打进4强。半决赛，莱赫奇卡挡住了他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "76c872bf2a51bf744879481c3a9f52f27c10ea657269f9ec06235ad569ddcb7a",
      "words_sha256": "498dedf0f339a9091a032c3d2e43c8c754b3cdccafebf1e4a22492f79f406edb",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "12cf1acc62971737a2723d1aad3d26a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再回上海，这次他不用等一个资格赛位置，直接以种子身份出场。可卫冕之旅止步第三轮，四比六、二比六，输给保罗。去年的奖杯还在，今天的比赛，仍然要从头打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "aff9d29cd8b64dbfe3d742ec6fe6a77d0e79c4b3cd8334518859e2317a94cd95",
      "words_sha256": "0f868dd36a3a828b407ec55bb0928ac6c38bfc04135559828c4dc9c16b6730f5",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ad76abbf6f37f30a15236dd35bc3e667",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "然后，是巴塞尔。先过纳沃内，再用两次抢七闯过霍达尔。对鲁内，十个破发点，他化解了九个。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0ba11fa1feaf1a9727b7718b000e3509a41155764f9098a18a9aab7bc2ac9da3",
      "words_sha256": "caa2ddbd41dc9ee7c0aa6b5e997832d684a733d5df9d2869b218bb3ac81f226b",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "77eb59ce1a99a531362e79d6ef30b278",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，再遇弗里茨。去年在这里，瓦舍罗输给了他。这一次，瓦舍罗赢了，终于再次打进巡回赛决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "22b16a56cc73ba1b8ef2d24710027e163a74d7754e34588b4dc9805c6989388a",
      "words_sha256": "44d7c5842a32a640a7e18651316bacaa7260f66acd57882d68ecf71de350b327",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f9be09074309b9d588d0545e391fbb73",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对手莱赫奇卡，不到一个月前，刚在东京击败过他。这次，又是先丢一盘。二比六之后，瓦舍罗连拿两个六比三。最后一分，交给现场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a7337b5317f7c673aec56d1576f2b430df2250b243c4977ca42d52b2818b7a2c",
      "words_sha256": "188d61c648ee2b4c81bd6bbc7a68c842cc81303b04e9d09f6d22b11987ef5bb6",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dfbf7d622e1660e60cba3de6d1fd8b28",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次夺冠，和跌跌撞撞后再捧杯，哪一次更打动你？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2874c0f60614bdcb5b1ef4fe8342d75b858580157164ddc3eb10c50b6c147f97",
      "words_sha256": "fd3081735e9e727e0e7ac73b1fffeac703e8a9758dee23c8ac3c939cd7612803",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1602e34c103e6994d4f1112b83d25c02",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海之后这一年，他再次捧起了奖杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1defae34861bea2b8d779a299a432bc3ac212c2c4ebfecf3729d2ecd951cb5c1",
      "words_sha256": "bb371455942874977b3cf9931ffff5c7dc8edb8ad37adc407760e65dfcb2a596",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
